  "implementation": [
    "Both installed cart drawer and full-cart use the existing MadeYours specification/review controller with DOM-safe presentation adapter; transient draft, explicit normalization, new Review after choice changes, saved unavailable IDs retained, cancel/Escape/focus and navigation guard.",
    "Existing cart UUID/product identity and actual variant UUIDs retained. Server line identity is a composite product/variant/configuration key, not a standalone UUID. Only an acknowledged canonical response replaces the accepted line.",
    "Unknown acknowledgement freezes one exact command/key; later auth/refusal cannot disprove earlier commit or create a new intent. Current identity/cart context retires private draft; closed receipt cannot restore active checkout.",
    "Canonical existing PATCH authority handles strict line_edit. Server hydration/merge/aggregate stock and private fact provenance remain authoritative; no client price/version/snapshot accepted.",
    "Proposed service-only SQL owns exact raw-microsecond revision CAS, canonical live buyer/epoch and checkout binding, target-only replacement/optional merge, unchanged unrelated JSON, current fact/stock acceptance, durable same-transaction receipt and closed-cart replay.",
    "Existing whole-cart writer/clear proposal uses same cart lock namespace and canonical ownership, preventing a read-owner/bind/write race. Liquid mutations derive contents and precondition from the same acknowledged server object; original raw revision retained through local queue/retry; no app-local counter. Opening a saved cart reads instead of writing cached local contents."
  ],
